<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>AJANIPE Family Contribution Hub</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f3f6f4;
      color: #24332b;
    }

    header {
      background: #14532d;
      color: white;
      padding: 28px 18px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 26px;
    }

    header p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 25px auto;
      padding: 0 16px;
    }

    .welcome {
      background: white;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    }

    .welcome h2 {
      color: #14532d;
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 15px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border-left: 4px solid #15803d;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .amount {
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #166534;
    }

    .notice {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 15px;
      background: #dcfce7;
      border-radius: 8px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px 15px;
      color: #52635a;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <h1>AJANIPE Family Contribution Hub</h1>
    <p>Transparency. Accountability. Family Unity.</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="welcome">
      <h2>Welcome to Our Family Hub</h2>

      <p>
        Our goal is to manage family contributions transparently,
        maintain accurate records, and strengthen accountability.
      </p>

      <p>
        Each active member has a monthly contribution obligation
        of <strong>GH₵20</strong>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Monthly Contribution</h3>
        <div class="amount">GH₵20</div>
        <p>Per active member</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Record Keeping</h3>
        <p>Organized contribution records and payment histories.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Transparency</h3>
        <p>Clear reporting to support family accountability.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="notice">
      <strong>Project status:</strong>
      Initial website prototype.

      <br>

      <strong>Important:</strong>
      This is an early demonstration page. Login, database,
      payment records, and user permissions have not yet been
      implemented.
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2026 AJANIPE Family Contribution Hub
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
